{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/wraith-the-oblivion/995940-ghostly-lovers","id":995940,"title":"Ghostly Lovers","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Wraith: The Oblivion"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-10-30T20:48:39-07:00","id":995940,"title":"Ghostly Lovers","content":"It is Halloween tomorrow, so I posit a question, how many people in the cWoD have ghostly lovers that come to their beds on a regular basis? The Arcanoi of Embody allows Wraiths to waive the Pathos cost when used in proximity of their Consorts, and I imagine Wraiths would make mortals their Consort before they became their lovers. What benefits would having mortal lovers give Wraiths? What advantage would mortals gain from having ghostly lovers?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11683-aya-tari","name":"Aya Tari","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5986"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-30T22:07:02-07:00","id":995961,"title":"","content":"Wasn't there an entire supplement about this?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-02T09:30:18-07:00","id":997196,"title":"","content":"Love Beyond Death<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1062-ajax","name":"Ajax","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1062_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2319"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-02T12:58:05-07:00","id":997320,"title":"","content":"Well, besides the obvious benefits in the &quot;friends with benefits&quot; sense...<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aya Tari</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/wraith-the-oblivion/995940-ghostly-lovers#post995940\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What benefits would having mortal lovers give Wraiths?</div> </div> </div> </div>In the reasonably likely case of a passion relating to any number of positive emotions: pathos bonanza!<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aya Tari</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/wraith-the-oblivion/995940-ghostly-lovers#post995940\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What advantage would mortals gain from having ghostly lovers?</div> </div> </div> </div>It's hard to beat the convenience of a lover who just appears in your bed and then goes away by morning, who never needs money, or rides anywhere, and never gets pregnant, and never has to be introduced to your parents.<br /> <br /> But it gets more interesting when you ask: what are the downsides? Your ghost lover doesn't really cease to exist in the morning. It's someone who can watch everything you do -- who you have to trust not to watch certain things, like say, what you're writing in your journal -- and who might have a jealous streak. The Hierarchy could catch on and your fantasy girl/boy could disappear without a whisper -- unless whoever caught them wants to extort hush payment of some kind, which could get all kinds of awful. Then we get to find out just how much your wraithfriend really loves you.<br /> <br /> BTW, Love Beyond Death was just art (maybe some fiction?), not really a RPG supplement per se. Those experimental WW people were never afraid to try something new and strange, were they?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4448-bphillips","name":"bphillips","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4448_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"30"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-02T14:30:04-07:00","id":997375,"title":"","content":"Yeah, I have a copy, and I have never found it useful. Interesting thing about using Embody near a consort is, while you cannot be heard or seen, you can physically interact with your environment, meaning that you can protect your consort.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11683-aya-tari","name":"Aya Tari","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5986"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}